And when you encounter something evil, think about how Jung saw it, which is always a positive thing. This is something I really like about Jung. He's very open and he's very positive. Like, even the the very bad things, there's still potential that it can transform into something better, that this is your future, that this is the way to go.

00:43:02.168 --> 00:43:20.968
